# Wraptors Tri-City — build-time environment variables.
# Set real values in Netlify (Site configuration → Environment variables),
# never in Git. Copy to .env.local only for local testing; .env* files
# other than this one are gitignored.
#
# Both are Web3Forms *access keys* (public form keys, one per inbox).
# A form stays disabled until its own key is set. Changing a key needs a
# new build, because Vite bakes VITE_* values in at build time.

# Customer enquiries: Quote form (homepage + every service page) and the
# Booking form (/book/). Inbox: the shop's (wrap@wraptorstricity.com).
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Franchise enquiries (/franchise/). Inbox: the Wraptors franchise team.
# Separate on purpose — the franchise form never uses the customer key.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_FRANCHISE_KEY=
